。那個人也沒進家裡。我也沒有打名片上的號碼。","reason":"Disambiguate that the visitor, not the speaker, did not enter the home.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/zh-TW/584.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-JP-28210-04-001-SHARED-06"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-JP-28210-05-001","locale":"en","turn":7,"field":"translation","before":"Compare the email address with the label. Is there a preferred delivery date?","after":"Compare the address in the email with the shipping label. Is there a preferred delivery date?","reason":"This is the physical lodging address contained in the message, not an email address.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/en/584.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-JP-28210-05-001-SHARED-07"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-JP-28210-05-001","locale":"vi","turn":7,"field":"translation","before":"So địa chỉ email với phiếu gửi. Có ngày mong muốn giao không?","after":"Hãy đối chiếu địa chỉ ghi trong email với phiếu gửi hàng. Anh/chị có ngày muốn hàng được giao đến không?","reason":"The physical address contained in the email must be checked, not the email address.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/vi/584.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-JP-28210-05-001-SHARED-07"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-JP-28210-05-001","locale":"id","turn":7,"field":"translation","before":"Cocokkan alamat email dan label. Ada tanggal kirim sampai yang diinginkan?","after":"Cocokkan alamat penginapan yang tertulis di email dengan label pengiriman. Ada tanggal pengantaran yang diinginkan?","reason":"The postal address inside the email must match the shipping label, not the email address.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/id/584.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-JP-28210-05-001-SHARED-07"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-JP-28210-05-001","locale":"zh-CN","turn":7,"field":"translation","before":"请核对邮件地址和运单。有希望送达的日期吗？","after":"请核对邮件中写的住宿地址与运单上的地址。您希望哪天送达？","reason":"Clarify postal address inside email rather than email address.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/zh-CN/584.json","turnId":"D